			"notes": "## Changes\n\n### Minecraft 26.1.x & 26.2.x Support\n- Migrated from Minecraft 1.21.11 to 26.1.2 with full API compatibility\n- **26.2 compatible** — Mixin Plugin auto-selects the correct render hook based on Minecraft version\n- Supports Minecraft >=26.1.0 <26.3.0\n\n### Build & Dependencies\n- Gradle 9.5.0, Fabric Loom 1.17-SNAPSHOT\n- Java 25 required\n- Relaxed dependency requirements: Fabric Loader >=0.19.0, Fabric API >=0.152.0+26.1\n\n### API Migrations\n- ClientCommandManager → ClientCommands\n- KeyBindingHelper → KeyMappingHelper\n- displayClientMessage → sendSystemMessage\n- GameRenderer.bobView updated for CameraRenderState\n- Render pipeline: BlendFunction → ColorTargetState, DepthTestFunction → DepthStencilState\n- ChunkPos record accessors\n\n### Fixes\n- CI: remapJar → jar (Loom 1.17)\n- CI: Java 21 → 25\n- Typos config compatibility"
		},
